<title>USA: USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</title>
<headline>USDA gross cutout hide and offal value.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hide and offal value from a typical slaughter steer for today was estimated at $8.43 per cwt live, down 0.05 when compared to Thursday's value. - USDA</p>
<p>FOB CENTRAL U.S. TODAY'S CALCULATIONS FOR BY-PRODUCT VALUE</p>
<p>(STEER) -			   Lbs   Price  Change   Value</p>
<p>Steer hide, butt brand	 4.94   78.00    -	 4.94</p>
<p>Tallow, edible		   1.20   21.25    -	 0.26</p>
<p>Tallow, packer bleachable    4.50   18.75    -	 0.84</p>
<p>Tongues, Swiss #1 Wht 0-3%   0.26  160.00    -	 0.42</p>
<p>Cheek meat, trmd		 0.32   65.75   -0.25    0.21</p>
<p>Head meat			  0.13   58.00    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Oxtail, selected		 0.16  138.50    -	 0.22</p>
<p>Hearts, reg, bone out	  0.38   27.00    -	 0.10</p>
<p>Lips, unscalded		  0.11   68.50    -	 0.08</p>
<p>Livers, slcted, gall off     0.96   37.00   -3.00    0.36</p>
<p>Tripe, scalded edible	  0.65   20.00    -	 0.13</p>
<p>Tripe, honeycomb bleached    0.15   47.00    -	 0.07</p>
<p>Lungs, inedible		  0.47    4.60    -	 0.02</p>
<p>Melts				0.14    6.25    -	 0.01</p>
<p>Meat bone ml, 50% blk/ton    3.70  276.00   -2.50    0.51</p>
<p>Blood meal, 85% blk/ton	0.60  585.00   -5.00    0.18</p>
<p>TOTAL :			   18.67			  8.43</p>
<p>The average value of hide and offal for the five days ending Friday, June 13, 1997 was estimated at 8.48 per cwt., down -0.09 from last week and up 0.06 from last year.</p>
<p>**HIDE WEIGHT ADJUSTED TO REFLECT SEASONAL CHANGE**</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
